## Independent Low-Priority Tasks (Control Group)
After verification, we will perform 3 "chore" tasks manually vs Nucleus-assisted to compare speed/quality.
1. **Task A:** Update [README.md](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/.gemini/antigravity/brain/7c654df4-b83e-43f9-8620-f15868ec39d1/README.md) (Manual).
2. **Task B:** Create a dummy config file (Nucleus Coder).
3. **Task C:** Audit log files (Nucleus Critic).
